From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add permanent event-ticket courier to Littleroot Town

Reference: pret/pokeemerald @ 5eff78649e7170a877b961ef0b3da13b81a16038

Keep the original S.S. Tidal destination logic, Pokemon Center Mystery Gift
deliveryman, and all legendary encounter completion logic unchanged.

A new always-present NPC is added to Littleroot Town near Professor Birch's
Lab. The NPC uses the existing Mystery Gift Man overworld graphic and gives
any missing event tickets. Ticket receipt sets only the same ship-enable /
receipt flags used by Emerald's original event distribution scripts.

